  Keys  (press any key to close)                                                
  ↑/↓/k/j          move the cursor                                              
  Enter/Space      open or switch to a connection, or toggle a group            
  ←/→/h/l          on a group: collapse / expand it                             
  /                filter the connection list                                   
  Esc              clear the filter                                             
  Alt+←/→  ^B ←/→  previous / next tab                                          
  ^B 1-9           switch to tab 1-9                                            
  Alt+↑/↓          previous / next open connection                              
  ^B n/c           new tab for the active connection (c runs claude)            
  ^B i/p           bootstrap / provision the connection in its own tab          
  ^B g             open the connection's group as tabs                          
  ^B m             move a connection to a group (or drag it)                    
  a/e/d  ^B a/e/d  add / edit / delete a connection                             
  ^B w  x          close tab (x on an ended tab)                                
  r                on an ended tab: reconnect                                   
  ^B Tab           move focus between list and terminal                         
  ^B [             scroll back (mouse wheel also scrolls)                       
  ^B b             hide or show the connection list                             
  ^B r             refresh connections from ssh_config                          
  ^B ^B            send the prefix key to the session                           
  ^B ?             show this help                                               
  q/^C  ^B q       quit                                                         
